<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta name="ROBOTS" content="NOINDEX, NOFOLLOW" />
    <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge,chrome=1" />
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <style>
      /* SuisseIntl */
      @font-face {
        font-family: "OKKO SuisseIntl Regular";
        src: url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Regular.woff2")
            format("woff2"),
          url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Regular.woff")
            format("woff"),
          url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Regular.ttf")
            format("truetype");
        font-display: fallback;
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "OKKO SuisseIntl Medium";
        src: url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Medium.woff2")
            format("woff2"),
          url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Medium.woff")
            format("woff"),
          url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Medium.ttf")
            format("truetype");
        font-display: fallback;
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "OKKO SuisseIntl Bold";
        src: url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Bold.woff2")
            format("woff2"),
          url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Bold.woff")
            format("woff"),
          url("https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/fonts/OKKO_SuisseIntl-Bold.ttf")
            format("truetype");
        font-display: fallback;
      }

      :root {
        --primary-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
        --secondary-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
        --tertiary-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.56);
        --background-color: #000;
        --user-info-background-color: #101011;
        --button-color: rgba(139, 136, 146, 0.32);
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "OKKO SuisseIntl Regular";
        background: var(--background-color);
      }
      .header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 16px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 16px;
      }
      .page_image {
        width: 100%;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .title {
        font-family: "OKKO SuisseIntl Bold";
        color: var(--primary-color);
        font-size: 24px;
        font-style: normal;
        line-height: 28px;
        margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .subtitle {
        color: var(--secondary-color);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-style: normal;
        line-height: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      .support-text {
        color: var(--secondary-color);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-style: normal;
        line-height: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .support-link {
        font-family: "OKKO SuisseIntl Medium";
        color: var(--primary-color);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-style: normal;
        line-height: 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .support-link-button {
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        justify-content: center;
        width: auto;
        background: var(--button-color);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 11px 22px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .support-link-span {
        margin: auto 0;
      }
      .user-info-wrap {
        background: var(--user-info-background-color);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px;
      }
      .user-info-point {
        color: var(--secondary-color);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-style: normal;
        line-height: 20px;
        margin: 0 0 4px;
      }
      .user-info-description {
        color: var(--tertiary-color);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-style: normal;
        line-height: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }
      .user-info-copy-block {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 600px) {
        .header {
          padding: 20px;
        }
        .content {
          padding: 48px;
        }
        .page_image {
          width: fit-content;
          margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .title {
          font-size: 27px;
          line-height: 32px;
          letter-spacing: -0.27px;
        }
        .subtitle {
          font-size: 17px;
          line-height: 26px;
          margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .support-text {
          font-size: 17px;
          line-height: 26px;
        }
        .support-link {
          font-size: 17px;
          line-height: 22px;
        }
        .user-info-point,
        .user-info-description {
          font-size: 17px;
          line-height: 22px;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
        .content {
          padding: 48px 132px;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
        .content {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: row-reverse;
          justify-content: center;
          gap: 64px;
          padding: 96px 82px 48px 82px;
        }
        .box {
          max-width: 500px;
        }
        .support-link-button {
          width: fit-content;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 1320px) {
        .header {
          justify-content: start;
          padding: 20px 72px 24px 72px;
        }
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 1720px) {
        .header {
          padding: 22px 96px 26px 96px;
        }
        .content {
          gap: 108px;
          padding: 116px 82px 64px 82px;
        }
        .title {
          font-size: 31px;
          line-height: 36px;
          letter-spacing: -0.31px;
          margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .subtitle {
          font-size: 20px;
          line-height: 30px;
          margin-bottom: 86px;
        }
        .support-text {
          font-size: 20px;
          line-height: 30px;
          margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .support-link {
          font-size: 20px;
          line-height: 26px;
        }
        .user-info-wrap {
          padding: 16px;
        }
        .user-info-point,
        .user-info-description {
          font-size: 20px;
          line-height: 26px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <script>
      function copy() {
        document.oncopy = function (e) {
          const t = {
            report: {
              datetime: document.getElementById("REQUEST-DATE").innerHTML,
              ip: document.getElementById("REQUEST-IP").innerHTML,
              id: document.getElementById("REQUEST-ID").innerHTML,
            },
          };
          e.clipboardData.setData("text", JSON.stringify(t));
          e.preventDefault();
        };
        document.execCommand("copy");
      }
    </script>
    <header class="header">
      <div>
        <picture>
          <source
            srcset="
              https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/logo_pc.svg
            "
            media="(min-width: 1720px)"
          />
          <source
            srcset="
              https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/logo_small_pc.svg
            "
            media="(min-width: 1320px)"
          />
          <source
            srcset="
              https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/logo_laptop.svg
            "
            media="(min-width: 1024px)"
          />
          <source
            srcset="
              https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/logo_mobile.svg
            "
            media="(min-width: 250px)"
          />
          <img
            class="page_image"
            src="https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/logo_small_pc.svg"
            alt="OKKO"
          />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main class="content">
      <picture>
        <source
          srcset="
            https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/cat_1x.png 1x,
            https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/cat_2x.png 2x
          "
          media="(min-width: 1320px)"
        />
        <source
          srcset="
            https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/cat_laptop_1x.png 1x,
            https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/cat_laptop_2x.png 2x
          "
          media="(min-width: 600px)"
        />
        <source
          srcset="
            https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/cat_mobile_1x.png 1x,
            https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/cat_mobile_2x.png 2x
          "
          media="(min-width: 250px)"
        />
        <img
          class="page_image"
          src="https://clients-static.okko.tv/web/page-403/images/cat_x1.png"
          alt="OKKO"
        />
      </picture>
      <div class="box">
        <h1 class="title">Отключите VPN или расширения</h1>

        <h2 class="subtitle">
          Вероятно, у вас включён VPN, Proxy или другие расширения, которые
          мешают подключению. Пожалуйста, отключите их и обновите страницу
        </h2>

        <p class="support-text">
          В случае, если проблема сохраняется — свяжитесь с поддержкой
        </p>
        <a href="https://t.me/OkkoSupportBot" class="support-link">
          <div class="support-link-button">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              width="26"
              height="26"
              viewBox="0 0 26 26"
              fill="none"
            >
              <g clip-path="url(#clip0_522_13)">
